<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank unaudited 1996 rises.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank unaudited 1996 rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 6.95     vs	     7.21</p>
<p>    Net		   10,326.85     vs	10,178.38</p>
<p>NOTES: Krung Thai Bank Plc is the second largest Thai bank in terms of assets. Fourth quarter figures not available.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
